href=\"http://www.sidewalkastronomers.us/id1.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     Website of the San Francisco Sidewalk Astronomers\n    </a>\n    （\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20170804214643/http://www.sidewalkastronomers.us/id1.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     页面存档备份\n    </a>\n    ，存于\n    <a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"互联网档案馆\">\n     互联网档案馆\n    </a>\n    ）\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://books.google.com/books?id=AyoDAAAAMBAJ&amp;pg=PA27&amp;dq=astronomy++%22street+corner%22&amp;lr=\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     Adventures in Street Corner Astronomy, Popular Science Mar 1921\n    </a>\n    （\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20150403014556/http://books.google.com/books?id=AyoDAAAAMBAJ&amp;pg=PA27&amp;dq=astronomy++%22street+corner%22&amp;lr=\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     页面存档备份\n    </a>\n    ，存于\n    <a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"互联网档案馆\">\n     互联网档案馆\n    </a>\n    ）\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229083819/http://www.fredericknewspost.com/sections/archives/fnp_display.htm?StoryID=81496&amp;current=true\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     Frederick News Post - What's it like ... to be a street corner astronomer?\n    </a>\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.codfw.main‐7bdf4b79bc‐htc46\nCached time: 20260606114812\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Module:Citation/CS1 (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent‐selective‐update, show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.221 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.256 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 572/1000000\nRevision size: 9595/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 20746/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 318/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 1/20\nUnstrip